              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Alivai mavindĩthya andũ onthe, makĩmea, Ĩkilĩlyei, nũndũ mũthenya ũũ nĩ mũtheu; o na mũtikethĩwe na woo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na andũ onthe makwata nzĩa mathi, maye, na manyw’e, na matwaanĩe kya ũya, na kũtana mũno, nũndũ nĩmamanyie ndeto ila mataviw’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
