              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na moona kũandĩkĩtwe mĩaonĩ, kana Yeova nĩweaie na kanyw’a wa Mose, ana ma Isilaeli mekalae malwandanĩ mbokanĩ ya mwei wa mũonza; ",
          "type": "text",
