            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũmbano w’onthe wa ala maumĩte kũtavwanĩ maseũvya malwanda, na mekala ala malwandanĩ: nũndũ kuma mĩthenya ya Yesua mwana wa Nuni kũvika mũthenya ũsu ana ma Isilaeli matyaaĩka ũu. Na kwaĩ ũtanu mwingĩ mũno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
